# VENDOR: verified SPS Rev4.1 interface vendor: SPS-Interfaces-Rev4.1-2026-08-01 bundle=fab12fd8594f311b6b9922ef9200aa7471b99fbb8f19c4461f62c1dcc3fc87a3
# CONSUMERS: verified SPS interface consumers: no copied normative tables
# REPORT: validated canonical SPSRunReportV2:
# AGGREGATION: validated canonical AggregationInputV2:
# COALITION-CLOSURE: validated canonical ArtifactIdentityEvidenceV2:
# SEMANTIC: schema-valid; semantic failure XF-REPLAY-001
# WITNESS: JSON Schema oneOf matched 0 alternatives
# V2-ONLY: uniform V2 package closure verified
# QUERY-ORDER: QueryKindV2 normative order mismatch
# SYNC: SPS Rev4.1 interfaces match the vendored snapshot
# REVISION: requested source revision mismatch
# COPIED-TABLE: copied normative interface tables remain
# VENDOR-DRIFT: manifest digest mismatch: interface-registry.json
# SCHEMA-LAYER: JSON Schema oneOf matched 0 alternatives
# MISSING-FRAGMENT: missing schema fragment target
# SOURCE-CLOSURE: manifest file closure mismatch
# COUPLED-DRIFT: manifest digest mismatch: interface-registry.json
